      "base_and_c1_crossfit": "Reuse and verify C2 crossfit_training.pkl and its locked stage-1 models: C1 trained on 2022 R7-R11 predicts R12-R16; C1 trained on R7-R16 predicts R17-R22. HGB forecasts underneath are themselves chronological expanding out-of-fold points. Every fit event precedes its scored event.",
      "selection_year": 2023,
      "selection_base": "HGB trained only on 2022 and C1 discovery expert trained on 2022 expanding HGB forecasts. No C1 model fitted on 2023 targets is used for selection.",
      "objective": "Equal-event weighted absolute-error loss on target_seconds minus honest C1 point, with training residual clipped to [-12,+12] seconds. Correction clipped to [-6,+6] seconds at prediction, with positive point lower bound 1 second.",
      "estimator": {
